How to compile:

Hashtable only UI:
in a fresh terminal, run the following commands
  - ensure you are in the Project2 folder
  rm -rf build
  mkdir build
  cd build

  cmake -G "Unix Makefiles" -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release ..
  cmake --build . --target autocomplete_server --parallel
  ./autocomplete_server ../data/allwords_wordset.json

For running the html for demo:
   in terminal use npx serve . or python3 -m http.server 8000
